cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the article."
title: "Ordinal Regression Kriging: analysis code for municipal dengue risk prediction in Mexico"
abstract: >-
  Code and data reproducing the analysis of Ordinal Regression Kriging (ORK),
  a spatial prediction framework that extends regression kriging to ordinal
  response variables by combining the conditional expectation of an ordinal
  regression model with ordinary kriging of its continuous out-of-fold
  residuals. Includes the nested validation under random and spatially blocked
  schemes, the comparison against baselines, the sensitivity analysis to the
  category coding, and the SHAP interpretability analysis.
